WEBVTT

00:10:24.387 --> 00:10:30.693
Once in 1939, we turned our backs
on Jewish children fleeing the Nazis.

00:10:30.693 --> 00:10:33.796
And it remains a blight
on our national reputation,

00:10:33.830 --> 00:10:37.133
as I fear the separation of children

00:10:37.167 --> 00:10:39.502
in the last administration
will be remembered.

00:10:40.136 --> 00:10:43.873
The point is that our esteem
and our power is enhanced

00:10:43.907 --> 00:10:45.942
when we rescue the desperate --

00:10:45.942 --> 00:10:48.511
and diminished when we don't.

00:10:48.545 --> 00:10:49.846
Still, I'm not naive.

00:10:49.879 --> 00:10:51.915
I knew my decision would be controversial,

00:10:51.948 --> 00:10:53.850
and indeed, for that decision,

00:10:53.883 --> 00:10:56.686
I was called on hate radio
and in social media

00:10:56.719 --> 00:10:58.655
everything but a child of God.